{"id":"u51","kelas":"kerja","no":4,"judul":"Email Profesional","title":"Professional Emails","emoji":"📧","ringkas":"Subjek, salam, isi, penutup, lampiran, dan singkatan umum","ready":true,"goals":["menulis **email profesional** dengan struktur yang jelas: subjek, salam, pembuka, isi, penutup","memakai ungkapan standar: [[I am writing to ...]], [[Please find attached ...]], [[I would appreciate it if ...]]","membedakan **formal** dan **semi-formal**, serta memilih salam dan penutup yang tepat","mengenali singkatan umum: [[ASAP]], [[FYI]], [[CC]], [[BCC]], [[RSVP]], [[EOD]]","membalas, meneruskan, dan menindaklanjuti email","menghindari kesalahan umum pada email kerja"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Email adalah cara komunikasi kerja yang paling sering dipakai. Email yang baik **singkat, jelas, dan sopan**, sehingga penerima langsung paham apa yang diminta. Di unit ini kamu belajar strukturnya dan ungkapan yang siap pakai."},{"t":"grammar","title":"1. Struktur email profesional","table":[["Bagian","Fungsi","Contoh"],["**Subject**","ringkasan isi dalam beberapa kata","[[Meeting Schedule for Monday]]"],["**Greeting**","salam","[[Dear Mr. Adi,]] / [[Hi Tom,]]"],["**Opening**","tujuan menulis","[[I am writing to confirm our meeting.]]"],["**Body**","isi dan permintaan","[[Could you send me the report by Friday?]]"],["**Closing sentence**","tindak lanjut","[[Please let me know if you have any questions.]]"],["**Sign-off**","penutup","[[Best regards,]] / [[Kind regards,]]"],["**Name & title**","tanda tangan","[[Dina Putri, Sales Officer]]"]]},{"t":"tip","title":"Subjek yang baik","text":"Subjek harus **spesifik dan singkat**: [[Invoice No. 245 – Payment Due 30 June]] lebih baik daripada [[Hello]] atau [[Important!!!]]. Penerima sering memutuskan membuka email hanya dari subjeknya."},{"t":"grammar","title":"2. Salam dan penutup","table":[["Situasi","Salam","Penutup"],["Formal, tidak tahu nama","[[Dear Sir or Madam,]]","[[Yours faithfully,]]"],["Formal, tahu nama","[[Dear Mr. Adi,]] / [[Dear Ms. Sari,]]","[[Yours sincerely,]] / [[Kind regards,]]"],["Semi-formal (rekan)","[[Hello Tom,]] / [[Hi Tom,]]","[[Best regards,]] / [[Regards,]]"],["Santai (tim dekat)","[[Hi team,]]","[[Thanks,]] / [[Cheers,]]"]]},{"t":"vocab","title":"3. Kosakata penting","items":[{"en":"subject line","id":"baris subjek","ex":"Write a clear subject line."},{"en":"recipient","id":"penerima","ex":"The recipient replied quickly."},{"en":"attachment","id":"lampiran","ex":"Please open the attachment."},{"en":"attach","id":"melampirkan","ex":"I attach the invoice."},{"en":"forward","id":"meneruskan","ex":"Please forward this to Finance."},{"en":"reply","id":"membalas","ex":"I'll reply tomorrow."},{"en":"draft","id":"konsep / draf","ex":"Here is the first draft."},{"en":"follow up","id":"menindaklanjuti","ex":"I'm following up on my last email."},{"en":"confirm","id":"mengonfirmasi","ex":"Please confirm your attendance."},{"en":"inquiry","id":"pertanyaan / permintaan informasi","ex":"I have an inquiry about the price."},{"en":"reminder","id":"pengingat","ex":"This is a friendly reminder."},{"en":"regarding","id":"mengenai","ex":"Regarding your request, ..."},{"en":"inbox","id":"kotak masuk","ex":"My inbox is full."},{"en":"out of office","id":"tidak di kantor","ex":"I'm out of office until Monday."}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"4. Ungkapan siap pakai","table":[["Fungsi","Ungkapan"],["Membuka","[[I am writing to inquire about ...]] / [[I am writing to confirm ...]]"],["Merujuk","[[Regarding your email of 5 May, ...]] / [[Further to our call, ...]]"],["Meminta","[[Could you please send me ...?]] / [[I would appreciate it if you could ...]]"],["Melampirkan","[[Please find attached ...]] / [[I have attached ...]]"],["Memberi tahu","[[I would like to inform you that ...]]"],["Meminta maaf","[[I apologise for the delay in replying.]]"],["Menutup","[[Please let me know if you need any further information.]] / [[I look forward to hearing from you.]]"],["Berterima kasih","[[Thank you for your prompt reply.]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"5. Singkatan umum","table":[["Singkatan","Arti","Contoh"],["**ASAP**","as soon as possible – secepat mungkin","[[Please reply ASAP.]]"],["**FYI**","for your information – sebagai informasi","[[FYI, the meeting is moved.]]"],["**CC**","carbon copy – tembusan terlihat","[[I'm CC-ing Mr. Adi.]]"],["**BCC**","blind carbon copy – tembusan tersembunyi","[[I'll BCC the team.]]"],["**EOD**","end of day – akhir hari kerja","[[Send it by EOD.]]"],["**RSVP**","mohon konfirmasi kehadiran","[[RSVP by Friday.]]"],["**ETA**","estimated time of arrival – perkiraan tiba/selesai","[[What's the ETA?]]"]]},{"t":"warn","title":"Hindari kesalahan umum","text":"Jangan menulis dengan **HURUF KAPITAL SEMUA** (terkesan marah), jangan memakai terlalu banyak tanda seru, dan periksa **nama penerima** dan **lampiran** sebelum menekan Send. Gunakan [[Reply all]] hanya bila semua orang perlu membaca balasanmu."},{"t":"dialog","title":"Contoh 1: Email meminta informasi","lines":[{"who":"Email","en":"Subject: Inquiry about Training Schedule","id":"Subjek: Pertanyaan tentang Jadwal Pelatihan"},{"who":"Email","en":"Dear Ms. Sari,","id":"Yth. Ibu Sari,"},{"who":"Email","en":"I am writing to inquire about the training schedule for new staff. Could you please send me the dates and the location?","id":"Saya menulis untuk menanyakan jadwal pelatihan staf baru. Bisakah Ibu mengirimkan tanggal dan lokasinya?"},{"who":"Email","en":"I would appreciate it if you could reply by Friday. Please let me know if you need any further information.","id":"Saya akan sangat berterima kasih jika Ibu dapat membalas sebelum Jumat. Mohon beri tahu saya jika Ibu butuh informasi tambahan."},{"who":"Email","en":"Kind regards, Dina Putri, Sales Officer","id":"Hormat saya, Dina Putri, Petugas Penjualan"}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Contoh 2: Email balasan dengan lampiran","lines":[{"who":"Email","en":"Subject: Re: Inquiry about Training Schedule","id":"Subjek: Re: Pertanyaan tentang Jadwal Pelatihan"},{"who":"Email","en":"Dear Dina,","id":"Yth. Dina,"},{"who":"Email","en":"Thank you for your email. Please find attached the schedule. The training will be held on 12 and 13 June in Room 3.","id":"Terima kasih atas emailmu. Terlampir jadwalnya. Pelatihan akan diadakan pada 12 dan 13 Juni di Ruang 3."},{"who":"Email","en":"Please confirm your attendance by EOD tomorrow. Best regards, Sari","id":"Mohon konfirmasi kehadiranmu paling lambat akhir hari besok. Salam, Sari"}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog: Mengoreksi email","lines":[{"who":"Tom","en":"Dina, can you check my email before I send it?","id":"Dina, bisakah kamu memeriksa emailku sebelum kukirim?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"Sure. The subject says 'Hello'. It would be better to write 'Updated Budget for May'.","id":"Tentu. Subjeknya 'Hello'. Lebih baik ditulis 'Updated Budget for May'."},{"who":"Tom","en":"Good idea. Should I write in capital letters to show it's urgent?","id":"Ide bagus. Apakah aku perlu menulis dengan huruf kapital agar terlihat mendesak?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"No, it may sound angry. Write 'by EOD today' instead.","id":"Jangan, nanti terdengar marah. Tulis saja 'by EOD today'."}]},{"t":"summary","items":["Struktur: **Subject → Greeting → Opening → Body → Closing → Sign-off**.","Formal: [[Dear Sir or Madam]] → [[Yours faithfully]]; tahu nama: [[Dear Mr. Adi]] → [[Yours sincerely]] / [[Kind regards]].","Siap pakai: [[I am writing to ...]], [[Please find attached ...]], [[I look forward to hearing from you.]]","Singkatan: [[ASAP]], [[FYI]], [[CC]], [[BCC]], [[EOD]], [[RSVP]], [[ETA]].","Hindari huruf kapital semua dan subjek yang tidak jelas."]}],"practice":[{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan singkatan dengan artinya:","pairs":[["ASAP","secepat mungkin"],["FYI","sebagai informasi"],["EOD","akhir hari kerja"],["RSVP","mohon konfirmasi kehadiran"],["BCC","tembusan tersembunyi"]],"exp":"Singkatan email.","k":"f0a45924"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kosakata dengan artinya:","pairs":[["attachment","lampiran"],["recipient","penerima"],["follow up","menindaklanjuti"],["draft","konsep"]],"exp":"Kosakata email.","k":"159ee32d"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan bagian email dengan contohnya:","pairs":[["Subject","Meeting Schedule for Monday"],["Greeting","Dear Mr. Adi,"],["Sign-off","Kind regards,"],["Opening","I am writing to confirm our meeting."]],"exp":"Bagian email.","k":"c2380bcc"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Subjek email yang paling baik adalah...","options":["Invoice No. 245 – Payment Due 30 June","Hello","Important!!!","Hi"],"answer":0,"exp":"Spesifik dan singkat.","k":"02af9924"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Salam yang tepat jika tidak tahu nama penerima adalah...","options":["Dear Sir or Madam,","Hey you,","Hi buddy,","To whom,"],"answer":0,"exp":"Formal.","k":"80d59cbd"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Penutup yang serasi dengan \"Dear Sir or Madam\" adalah...","options":["Yours faithfully,","Yours sincerely,","Cheers,","See ya,"],"answer":0,"exp":"Dear Sir or Madam → Yours faithfully.","k":"34ddca25"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Ungkapan untuk melampirkan file adalah...","options":["Please find attached the report.","I lost the report.","The report is long.","Report me."],"answer":0,"exp":"Please find attached.","k":"c3be6142"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Ungkapan pembuka email yang baik adalah...","options":["I am writing to confirm our meeting.","Listen to me.","Why not reply?","Hey, wake up."],"answer":0,"exp":"Menyatakan tujuan.","k":"f6e2d0b4"},{"type":"mcq","q":"\"Please reply ASAP.\" artinya...","options":["Mohon balas secepat mungkin","Mohon balas bulan depan","Jangan balas","Balas kepada ASAP"],"answer":0,"exp":"ASAP.","k":"59e1ae2d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kapan memakai Reply all?","options":["bila semua orang perlu membaca balasan","selalu","tidak pernah","saat marah"],"answer":0,"exp":"Hindari spam.","k":"053811a4"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mengapa tidak menulis dengan huruf kapital semua?","options":["terkesan marah","lebih cepat","lebih sopan","lebih rapi"],"answer":0,"exp":"Kapital = berteriak.","k":"e45954ad"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Ungkapan untuk meminta maaf karena terlambat membalas adalah...","options":["I apologise for the delay in replying.","You are late.","I never reply.","Why wait?"],"answer":0,"exp":"apologise for the delay.","k":"bb3da3c5"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Penutup yang baik untuk email adalah...","options":["I look forward to hearing from you.","Do not write again.","Goodbye forever.","Whatever."],"answer":0,"exp":"Sopan.","k":"b7f466dc"},{"type":"fill","id":"Mohon lihat lampiran.","q":"Please find ___ the report.","answers":["attached"],"hint":"terlampir","exp":"attached.","k":"1ad60828"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya menulis untuk mengonfirmasi rapat.","q":"I am ___ to confirm the meeting.","answers":["writing"],"hint":"V-ing","exp":"writing to.","k":"2abaead9"},{"type":"fill","id":"Terima kasih atas balasan cepat Anda.","q":"Thank you for your ___ reply.","answers":["prompt","quick","fast"],"hint":"cepat","exp":"prompt reply.","k":"e4fe43d4"},{"type":"fill","id":"Mohon konfirmasi kehadiran Anda.","q":"Please ___ your attendance.","answers":["confirm"],"hint":"mengonfirmasi","exp":"confirm.","k":"383dffa1"},{"type":"fill","id":"Mengenai permintaan Anda, ...","q":"___ your request, ...","answers":["regarding","Regarding"],"hint":"mengenai","exp":"Regarding.","k":"6d0343b3"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya tidak di kantor sampai Senin.","q":"I'm out of ___ until Monday.","answers":["office"],"hint":"kantor","exp":"out of office.","k":"559e6da6"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Beri tahu saya jika Anda punya pertanyaan.\"","answer":"Please let me know if you have any questions.","exp":"Please let me know if ...","k":"173ea1d3"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Saya menantikan balasan Anda.\"","answer":"I look forward to hearing from you.","exp":"look forward to + V-ing.","k":"73a2bef4"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"Please find attached the invoice","options":["Mohon lihat faktur yang terlampir","Faktur itu hilang","Aku membayar faktur","Faktur itu lama"],"answer":0,"exp":"attached.","k":"343a4415"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"I would appreciate it if you could reply by Friday","options":["Saya akan menghargai jika Anda membalas sebelum Jumat","Saya balas hari Jumat","Anda tidak perlu membalas","Jumat libur"],"answer":0,"exp":"would appreciate it if.","k":"fafa2bd2"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"I am writing to inquire about the schedule","options":["Saya menulis untuk menanyakan jadwal","Saya mengubah jadwal","Jadwal saya penuh","Saya tidak punya jadwal"],"answer":0,"exp":"inquire = menanyakan.","k":"2ad02ab6"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya menulis untuk menanyakan harga.","q":"I am writing to ___ about the price.","answers":["inquire","enquire"],"hint":"menanyakan","exp":"inquire about.","k":"f4c7e248"},{"type":"fill","id":"Mohon beri tahu saya jika Anda butuh informasi lain.","q":"Please let me ___ if you need more information.","answers":["know"],"hint":"tahu","exp":"let me know.","k":"c49071e1"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya ingin memberi tahu Anda bahwa rapat dipindahkan.","q":"I would like to ___ you that the meeting is moved.","answers":["inform"],"hint":"memberi tahu","exp":"inform.","k":"4b783b1d"},{"type":"fill","id":"Terima kasih atas email Anda.","q":"Thank you for your ___.","answers":["email"],"hint":"email","exp":"Thank you for your email.","k":"a8360def"},{"type":"fill","id":"Ini pengingat ramah.","q":"This is a friendly ___.","answers":["reminder"],"hint":"pengingat","exp":"reminder.","k":"e7e73ee6"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya akan menindaklanjuti besok.","q":"I will follow ___ tomorrow.","answers":["up"],"hint":"up","exp":"follow up.","k":"593399f0"},{"type":"fill","id":"Maaf atas keterlambatan.","q":"I apologise ___ the delay.","answers":["for"],"hint":"preposisi","exp":"apologise for.","k":"f67e72e9"},{"type":"fill","id":"Rapat dipindahkan ke hari Selasa.","q":"The meeting has been ___ to Tuesday. (move)","ans